WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:50.720
Someone once said...

00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:56.420
There are fresh vegetables 
harvested and bundled together

00:01:56.420 --> 00:02:01.100
that look like vividly colored 
hydrangea in bloom...

00:02:01.460 --> 00:02:05.600
Hydranveggiea!

00:02:06.530 --> 00:02:12.810
There are soft, flaky sweet potatoes 
with nicely browned, aromatic skin

00:02:12.810 --> 00:02:16.380
that are piled on top of each 
other like a stone wall...

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:20.150
Stone Wall Potatoes!

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:23.880
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:23.880 --> 00:02:29.420
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:31.320 --> 00:02:36.700
New Phase! Toriko's Decision 
and the Reunion with "Him"!

00:02:40.670 --> 00:02:42.140
IGO...

00:02:44.070 --> 00:02:46.640
"Restricted Area"?

00:02:52.980 --> 00:02:57.450
All the way out here, even the air 
tastes good, doesn't it, Komatsu?

00:02:57.450 --> 00:03:00.250
The forest air is fine...

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:03.090
...but we did come here to 
enjoy a super-special meal

00:03:03.090 --> 00:03:06.090
you can't really get anywhere else, right?

00:03:06.090 --> 00:03:07.960
You said we were almost there,

00:03:07.960 --> 00:03:11.660
but that was about five hours ago and 
we've been walking all this time...

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:18.440
Anyway, this is kind of an 
unusual forest, isn't it?

00:03:18.440 --> 00:03:19.970
Right, Toriko-san?

00:03:22.910 --> 00:03:24.410
What's wrong?

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:35.020
I've got that bad feeling again...

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:37.490
Stay right behind me, Komatsu.

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:07.450
Oxchicken (Avian Beast) Capture Level 49

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:15.390
Fork Shield!

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:24.800
Komatsu, take a little break!

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:34.380
Instead of facing it head on, 
if I time it just right...

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:48.260
Toriko-san!

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:53.300
17-fold Spiked Punch!

00:05:04.870 --> 00:05:06.170
Toriko-san!

00:05:06.770 --> 00:05:08.410
Are you alright?!

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:09.340
Yeah...

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:15.680
It's because I went through autophagy, 
then drank my fill of Mellow Cola.

00:05:16.020 --> 00:05:19.350
My Gourmet Cells were invigorated.

00:05:19.350 --> 00:05:22.790
To think, you took down a Beast 
like that in no time flat!

00:05:22.790 --> 00:05:24.760
It's amazing, Toriko-san!

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:27.800
Oh, I still have a ways to go.

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:31.370
Besides, I'm sure the old man 
has also tasked the other two

00:05:31.370 --> 00:05:33.570
with capturing some pretty 
hard training ingredients.

00:05:53.150 --> 00:05:55.460
So this is the Road of Three Hells...

00:05:56.660 --> 00:06:00.090
One of the roads that connects the 
Gourmet World and the Human World...

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:03.130
One of the places I've been 
told to go to for my training.

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:09.700
I've heard that an employee of 
Biotope 0 is encamped here alone,

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:14.110
keeping the Beasts from the 
Gourmet World at bay...

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:19.780
You are that man, aren't you? 
The Gourmet Gang Leader, Guemon.

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:38.730
Powerful electromagnetic waves...

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:42.930
It seems that what lies ahead 
is beyond my imagination.

00:06:43.200 --> 00:06:44.640
Just what the doctor ordered...

00:06:44.970 --> 00:06:48.270
Since if it were a comfortable place, 
I wouldn't get any training out of it.

00:06:57.850 --> 00:07:00.650
The plan isn't delayed, Joe Joe?

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:02.690
No... As you can see...

00:07:09.590 --> 00:07:12.900
Everything else is also as 
you instructed, Alfaro-sama.

00:07:12.900 --> 00:07:19.170
Arrangements are already underway to 
mass produce the new GT robot model.

00:07:19.770 --> 00:07:23.440
That sounds like I can give 
the boss a good report.

00:07:23.440 --> 00:07:27.640
I believe we may also proceed even 
sooner with usurping all ingredients.

00:07:27.640 --> 00:07:33.080
Yes, because the Gourmet Corp. must 
capture GOD before anyone else does...

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:43.290
We're deep in the forest, huh?

00:07:43.290 --> 00:07:44.260
Yep.

00:07:44.260 --> 00:07:47.600
Anyway, do you think it's 
really going to happen?

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:51.000
A war over GOD...

00:07:52.430 --> 00:07:55.040
GOD, the ingredient that 
stopped the Gourmet War,

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:57.370
which had been going on for 100 years...

00:07:57.370 --> 00:08:04.050
Ironic that its reappearance now could 
very likely trigger a new war...

00:08:04.910 --> 00:08:09.080
I always thought GOD was just a legend.

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:11.350
But it's an actual ingredient, wow...

00:08:11.350 --> 00:08:14.220
The Gourmet Eclipse, the 
existence of the Nitro...

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:16.160
...and the Gourmet Corp.

00:08:16.160 --> 00:08:19.130
There's still so much we 
don't understand, huh?

00:08:19.130 --> 00:08:23.400
Anyway, if we get GOD, all we have 
to do is share it with everybody.

00:08:23.400 --> 00:08:25.600
If we do that, war will be averted.

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:29.140
As long as we don't get in 
a fight with Zebra-san...

00:08:29.140 --> 00:08:32.940
Come to think of it, Zebra-san didn't 
seem to have much interest in it...

00:08:32.940 --> 00:08:37.310
In the first place, that guy's not even 
interested in Acacia's Full Course.

00:08:37.310 --> 00:08:42.950
He could care less about Nitro, 
the Gourmet Corp., even GOD.

00:08:42.950 --> 00:08:43.850
Huh...

00:08:43.850 --> 00:08:46.990
More important to him are the conditions 
of his release from prison.

00:08:46.990 --> 00:08:52.030
He has to capture 500 wanted felons 
and discover 100 new ingredients.

00:08:52.030 --> 00:08:54.160
That's his priority.

00:08:54.160 --> 00:08:58.830
And then he also has to decide on his Full 
Course for when you two become partners.

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:12.850
Think you're gonna eat me?

00:09:15.050 --> 00:09:18.180
Ain't smart to get cocky!

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:24.820
I bet Zebra-san will put together 
a stupendous Full Course...

00:09:24.820 --> 00:09:25.990
Look, Komatsu.

00:09:35.830 --> 00:09:40.410
Black Lake... It really is pitch black!

00:09:40.410 --> 00:09:45.410
Bluish strong volcanic rocks, reddish 
soil, and yellow sand melted into the lake

00:09:45.410 --> 00:09:48.280
and when their three colors 
mix, it looks like black.

00:09:48.280 --> 00:09:49.810
Alright, shall we go?

00:09:50.680 --> 00:09:52.720
To that shop?

00:09:52.720 --> 00:09:54.350
It's on the lake...

00:09:54.350 --> 00:09:55.490
How do we get there from here?

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:58.420
Like this. Hang on tight!

00:10:01.690 --> 00:10:03.490
I'm gonna fall!

00:10:13.600 --> 00:10:15.440
We made it, Komatsu.

00:10:17.810 --> 00:10:20.240
Bar Meria?

00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:25.620
It's kind of dark, huh?

00:10:25.980 --> 00:10:27.990
Maybe nobody's here...

00:10:32.660 --> 00:10:34.020
Welcome.

00:11:07.590 --> 00:11:11.790
Toriko-san, about the owner, Meria-san...

00:11:11.790 --> 00:11:14.260
Oh. She's a GT robot.

00:11:14.930 --> 00:11:17.130
This is dangerous territory,

00:11:17.130 --> 00:11:21.400
too dangerous for a normal human to 
smoothly run a shop in the flesh.

00:11:21.400 --> 00:11:25.740
But why would she go to the trouble of 
using a GT robot to have a shop here?

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:27.640
Because there's a demand.

00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:33.480
Presidents of major nations and ministers of 
state come here with their security detail,

00:11:33.480 --> 00:11:37.090
as do more unsavory characters, 
to conduct shady business deals.

00:11:38.350 --> 00:11:41.490
As a place to discuss things 
that better not be overheard,

00:11:41.490 --> 00:11:44.090
there's no better location 
than dangerous territory.

00:11:44.090 --> 00:11:45.730
I see...

00:11:45.730 --> 00:11:49.030
But Toriko-san, you're 
drooling up a puddle there...

00:11:49.330 --> 00:11:51.300
Alright, let's eat!

00:11:51.800 --> 00:11:52.570
Right!

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:57.270
I give thanks for all this world's bounty.

00:11:57.270 --> 00:11:58.740
Let's eat!

00:12:04.110 --> 00:12:05.380
Delicious!

00:12:05.380 --> 00:12:11.990
This burger made from that Oxchicken meat 
we brought over is absolutely delicious!

00:12:11.990 --> 00:12:13.550
What do you think, Komatsu?

00:12:14.320 --> 00:12:17.620
We came all the way here 
to eat this burger, right?

00:12:18.060 --> 00:12:22.860
But it was totally worth making the trek!

00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:28.840
Delicious! And we got french 
fries from Potato Rats, too!

00:12:28.840 --> 00:12:31.200
You're having a fine harvest 
this season, Meria.

00:12:31.200 --> 00:12:32.000
Yes.

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:36.510
The rats aren't under much stress, 
so we can get tasty fries from them.

00:12:37.010 --> 00:12:39.210
There's more where this came 
from, so eat up, Toriko.

00:12:39.210 --> 00:12:39.980
I will!

00:12:41.180 --> 00:12:42.480
There it is!

00:12:42.480 --> 00:12:45.550
Jet Black Rice and dried Jewel Meat!

00:12:46.290 --> 00:12:51.160
I'll put the dried Jewel Meat 
into this Gourmet Spicer...

00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:52.260
Salt...

00:12:52.260 --> 00:12:53.090
Nori...

00:12:53.560 --> 00:12:54.960
A bit of sesame...

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:57.800
Then crush it finely...

00:12:59.400 --> 00:13:01.500
...and sprinkle it on top 
of the Jet Black Rice!

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:09.410
It looks delicious!

00:13:10.840 --> 00:13:15.510
Adding the rich taste of the Jewel 
Meat to the chewy Jet Black Rice

00:13:15.510 --> 00:13:18.820
gives it an indescribable aroma and flavor!

00:13:19.420 --> 00:13:21.020
Please have seconds.

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:24.860
Also give me a malt whiskey 
on the rocks, Meria.

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:26.420
Certainly.

00:13:30.230 --> 00:13:35.330
The old man gave me a total of seven 
ingredients to track down for my training.

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:37.600
There are four left, but...

00:13:38.600 --> 00:13:42.770
For the time being, I'm thinkin' I'll take 
my time hunting them down, go at my own pace.

00:13:42.770 --> 00:13:45.780
After all, there are tons of other 
ingredients I wanna get, too.

00:13:47.480 --> 00:13:49.550
Besides, Komatsu...

00:13:49.910 --> 00:13:51.580
There's you to think about.

00:13:51.580 --> 00:13:53.050
Me?

00:13:58.350 --> 00:14:00.420
Oh, there's one more thing.

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:04.390
Actually, for the past several 
decades in the Human World,

00:14:04.390 --> 00:14:09.330
there's been an increase in the number of 
Nitro sightings and incidents related to them.

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:14.700
One famous chef after another 
has been abducted by the Nitro.

00:14:15.840 --> 00:14:19.840
Do they wish to steal the advanced 
techniques of humans who create delicious dishes?

00:14:19.840 --> 00:14:21.710
Or is it simply...

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:25.950
...because they want to prepare 
humans and then eat them?

00:14:27.620 --> 00:14:30.520
That book I found in the Gourmet Pyramid...

00:14:30.520 --> 00:14:33.790
There were some recipes in there 
that sent shivers down my spine!

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:36.360
Komatsu-san...

00:14:36.730 --> 00:14:39.830
You yourself are the head chef 
at a six-star restaurant.

00:14:39.830 --> 00:14:41.660
Please be very cautious.

00:14:41.930 --> 00:14:43.230
Okay...

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:44.970
At the moment, the kid hasn't even cracked

00:14:44.970 --> 00:14:47.600
the top 100 of the "World's 
Best Chef" ranking,

00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:49.040
so he should have nothing to worry about.

00:14:49.040 --> 00:14:52.810
Stow it, Chief! Komatsu's 
talent is top-level!

00:14:54.940 --> 00:14:59.610
Our latest jaunt from the Desert 
Labyrinth to the Gourmet Pyramid

00:14:59.610 --> 00:15:02.480
made me realize how lacking I 
am in the strength department.

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:05.550
I am worried about a Gourmet War...

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:09.020
And it is important to hurry up with my 
training so I can go to the Gourmet World...

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:14.630
But there's no way I can save the world if 
I can't first adequately protect the life

00:15:14.630 --> 00:15:17.830
of the one person right in front of me.

00:15:18.530 --> 00:15:20.430
Slow and steady wins the race.

00:15:20.430 --> 00:15:23.600
There are still a lot of delicious 
ingredients in the Human World.

00:15:23.600 --> 00:15:25.770
The Gourmet World can wait 
'til I'm done with them.

00:15:26.040 --> 00:15:27.410
Toriko-san!

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:38.080
Tagging along on Toriko-san's 
travels has been nerve-wracking...

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:43.620
Let's team up, and make the 
ultimate Full Course, together.

00:15:43.620 --> 00:15:46.490
Why did you eat that first?!

00:15:46.490 --> 00:15:48.460
He's a real ogre!

00:15:49.730 --> 00:15:52.570
Let's begin preparing Mellow Cola!

00:15:55.030 --> 00:15:58.300
...but more than that, 
it's been thrilling, so...

00:15:59.440 --> 00:16:02.170
From here on out, too, I go where you go!

00:16:02.710 --> 00:16:07.180
No matter where it is! To 
prepare, I'll get stronger, too!

00:16:07.180 --> 00:16:09.680
Thanks, Komatsu!

00:16:37.480 --> 00:16:40.480
Toriko-san! Who is he?!

00:16:42.310 --> 00:16:46.680
Scent can make you recall memories 
of your past and emotions.

00:16:46.680 --> 00:16:49.590
It's said that the sense 
of smell is processed

00:16:49.590 --> 00:16:52.160
in the limbic system, which governs emotions.

00:16:52.720 --> 00:16:55.460
But this wasn't a scent. It was a voice!

00:16:55.930 --> 00:16:59.060
The impact of that faint sound 
coming from his mouth...

00:16:59.060 --> 00:17:02.300
It gave me plenty of information 
to bring back memories!

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:06.000
I'll never forget it...

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:07.100
That sense of terror...

00:17:16.980 --> 00:17:21.180
Who would've thought we'd 
meet in a place like this?

00:17:22.320 --> 00:17:24.320
Are you in the middle of a meal?

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:28.890
I'm looking for a certain ingredient.

00:17:28.890 --> 00:17:32.190
An ingredient? What ingredient?

00:17:34.400 --> 00:17:39.200
I'm not sure... But I bet if I 
eat it, it'll come back to me.

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:48.180
As a Gourmet Hunter...

00:17:49.410 --> 00:17:51.210
And as a chef...

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:55.250
You've both grown since then.

00:17:55.580 --> 00:17:58.520
It's easier to tell when I see 
you like this, with my own eyes.

00:17:59.420 --> 00:18:01.220
You make a good combo.

00:18:02.790 --> 00:18:05.460
Don't tell me... you wanna 
have it out here an' now?!

00:18:05.460 --> 00:18:08.530
Yeah. That's not a bad idea.

00:18:17.170 --> 00:18:18.370
You're slow.

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:23.440
It took you .5 seconds to prepare for battle.

00:18:23.440 --> 00:18:25.450
I could have killed you 
easily ten times over.

00:18:27.820 --> 00:18:30.180
Don't worry, Toriko.

00:18:30.180 --> 00:18:32.490
I'm not in the mood to throw 
down with you right now.

00:18:34.120 --> 00:18:38.020
You see, I really did just come here to eat.

00:18:39.190 --> 00:18:42.330
However... in the not too distant future...

00:18:42.330 --> 00:18:44.400
...there will be war.

00:18:45.430 --> 00:18:49.940
When that happens, the stakes will be 
GOD, uttering its mellow birth cry,

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:53.670
and the robust resurgence 
of Acacia's Full Course.

00:18:53.970 --> 00:18:55.640
It'll be a showdown, Toriko!

00:18:55.640 --> 00:18:57.480
Just what I wanted to hear...

00:18:57.480 --> 00:18:58.710
...Starjun!

00:19:18.860 --> 00:19:22.470
I left without laying a hand on them...

00:19:22.470 --> 00:19:27.170
That's the best outcome 
they could've hoped for.

00:19:28.710 --> 00:19:30.310
It's fortune.

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:32.910
Their Gourmet Fortune...

00:19:33.950 --> 00:19:37.220
Toriko's Gourmet Cells 
still have room for growth

00:19:37.220 --> 00:19:40.080
and they will grow if he eats 
delicious ingredients...

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:44.790
But he won't get anywhere with ingredients 
or his training on Gourmet Fortune alone.

00:19:45.820 --> 00:19:51.430
Gourmet Fortune is the natural gifts one 
possesses, as well as talent blessed by food...

00:19:51.430 --> 00:19:54.800
That's one thing I lack.

00:19:55.330 --> 00:19:57.200
And I want it.

00:19:57.200 --> 00:20:00.270
If I had that, then the 
ingredient I'm seeking out...

00:20:05.710 --> 00:20:08.410
Thank goodness, Toriko-san!

00:20:08.880 --> 00:20:12.880
I really thought we were gonna die!

00:20:12.880 --> 00:20:14.580
We were lucky, huh?

00:20:15.790 --> 00:20:17.350
Luck, huh?

00:20:17.920 --> 00:20:22.090
I've never been there before, 
but maybe we oughta go.

00:20:22.090 --> 00:20:26.200
The place that houses Acacia's 
statue, the Gourmet Shrine!

00:20:31.670 --> 00:20:34.370
We give thanks for this food, let's eat!

00:20:38.570 --> 00:20:40.210
Yuuuu... Toriko!

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:42.950
Potassium, manganese, calcium, 
starch, fructose, and dextrose

00:20:42.950 --> 00:20:45.780
Magnesium, iron, vitamins ABCDE

00:20:45.780 --> 00:20:48.620
Vanadium, sodium, glucosamine, chondroitin

00:20:48.620 --> 00:20:51.450
Carotintintin, lycopenpenpene, 
isoflavonvonvone

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:54.190
Celery, goya, and green peas

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:56.990
Shiitake, liver, eggplant, bell pepper

00:20:56.990 --> 00:20:59.700
What a shame to say "I don't 
even want to look at them!"

00:20:59.700 --> 00:21:01.360
Even if you hate it, gobble 
it down 3 times or 4 times

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:02.800
and it'll be more and more

00:21:02.800 --> 00:21:04.130
Yuuuu... Toriko!

00:21:04.130 --> 00:21:06.940
Eat 'em up more! Eat 'em up more!

00:21:06.940 --> 00:21:09.800
More and more and more and 
more and more! Eat 'em all up!

00:21:09.800 --> 00:21:14.080
Delicious things are delicious!  
Not even giving them a chance…

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:15.410
Such a waste!

00:21:15.410 --> 00:21:18.250
Gobble 'em down more! Gobble 'em down more!

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:21.050
Majorly, deeply, plentifully, 
heartily, gobble 'em down!

00:21:21.050 --> 00:21:26.650
They enrich your body and spirit! 
Be grateful to your meals today!

00:21:26.650 --> 00:21:29.560
Thanks for the food! All done!

00:21:31.630 --> 00:21:33.160
Dishing with Tina!

00:21:33.530 --> 00:21:36.560
It's "Dishing with Tina", the talk 
show with a heaping helping of fun!

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:41.440
Our guest today is the warden 
of Honey Prison, Warden Love!

00:21:41.440 --> 00:21:44.470
Hey! Get me on camera!

00:21:44.470 --> 00:21:46.170
Hi there! I'm Love!

00:21:46.170 --> 00:21:50.010
Alright, this time we'll find out 
what Warden Love's really like

00:21:50.010 --> 00:21:53.780
by appraising her favorite thing!

00:21:54.150 --> 00:21:57.480
So without further ado, let's unveil it!

00:21:57.480 --> 00:21:59.420
Ta-daa!

00:22:00.120 --> 00:22:02.390
A d-diamond!

00:22:05.860 --> 00:22:07.660
It's not just any diamond.

00:22:07.660 --> 00:22:10.030
It's one of a very few super-special minerals

00:22:10.030 --> 00:22:12.300
brought forth from the Death Season Forest.

00:22:12.300 --> 00:22:14.800
It's probably worth about 
100 years of your salary!

00:22:16.840 --> 00:22:18.440
This shape...

00:22:18.740 --> 00:22:20.470
Like this...?

00:22:20.470 --> 00:22:24.880
Um... It's a heaping helping of huge 
when I wear it as a bracelet...

00:22:24.880 --> 00:22:26.610
Don't tell me it's a handcuff?

00:22:26.610 --> 00:22:32.020
Exactly! 'Til recently, that very item 
was locked around Zebra-chan's wrist.

00:22:32.020 --> 00:22:34.050
Z-Z-Zebra?!

00:22:37.160 --> 00:22:38.990
Hey! What's this zero?!

00:22:38.990 --> 00:22:42.460
My Zebra-chan was restrained by that!

00:22:42.460 --> 00:22:44.900
Um... Please take it away.

00:22:44.900 --> 00:22:47.030
I don't want to have 
anything to do with Zebra!

00:22:47.030 --> 00:22:52.370
Don't be talkin' nonsense!

00:22:54.340 --> 00:22:57.740
Zebra-chan, you came for me?!

00:22:57.740 --> 00:23:00.950
I am the number one person 
in your life, aren't I?

00:23:00.950 --> 00:23:02.550
Zebra!

00:23:02.550 --> 00:23:05.050
Alright, let's go on to the next segment!

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:09.690
We're here at what's known as a power spot for food.

00:23:09.890 --> 00:23:11.790
Food professionals are strutting their stuff...

00:23:11.790 --> 00:23:14.020
Wait, is that Toriko and Komatsu?

00:23:14.760 --> 00:23:17.490
Food Luck Runneth Over! Pilgrimage to the Gourmet Shrine!

00:23:17.690 --> 00:23:19.320
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
